hi i'm nick gillespie i'm with matt  welch where the co-authors of the  Declaration of Independence how  libertarian politics can fix what's  wrong with America it's out in paperback  at the end of the month we're doing ask  a libertarian 2012 Matt the next  question comes from Morgan Stanton by  email why would any sensible libertarian  support abandoning Afghanistan to the  Taliban and eventually to al-qaeda first  I'm not sensible but second I think the  question is sort of based on a series of  misnomers one is that somehow the United  States is responsible for every  government in the world or at least the  government of Afghanistan simply by  virtue of the fact that we overthrew  their government a long time ago and are  still involved in war there we can't  take responsibility for every single  country in the world that's part of the  reason what we have an unaffordable  government right now we're spending  forty three percent of the world's money  on military spending overall and it also  builds in the assumption that there  isn't any cost associated with trying to  run other countries there's a pretty  good reason to suspect that this is one  of the things that builds resentment  towards American policies and builds  very real life threatening situations  for US soldiers abroad it's not a happy  task to deal with really lousy countries  that are dirt poor Afghanistan in the  1990s under the Tannum Taliban was one  of the worst countries in the modern  history of the world it's not an easy  question but I don't think that  withdrawing troops from a screwed-up  situation that is putting us at risk is  a tantamount to abandoning a country you  know we went into Afghanistan to chase  after bin Laden we lost the trail there  we should have been out of there  time ago Taliban is totally rotten evil  to the core we can help Afghans or other  people push back against that kind of  repression that doesn't mean leaving  troops in there indefinitely and it  doesn't mean pulling out is an  abandonment of American principles we're  here all day ask a libertarian keep  sending us your questions on Facebook  email Twitter YouTube and all the other  tubes see you soon  you
 

